{"name": "Star Conflict: Burrownauts", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras_big/ba372b3d457dca37d5b60b409d952db7.webp?t=1788947938\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/ba372b3d457dca37d5b60b409d952db7.avif?t=1788947938\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity left Earth long ago in search of a new home, but colonizing the galaxies turned out to be far from simple. Now, survival depends on the resources extracted by space miners on distant planetoids, and you are one of them. Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter familiar ships and technologies from the Star Conflict universe, but you will see them from a different perspective: through dangerous expeditions, resource mining, and the search for traces of forgotten civilizations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/5d10b4f5885fb6783c1b16e8dc5fee2a.poster.avif?t=1788947938\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/5d10b4f5885fb6783c1b16e8dc5fee2a.webm?t=1788947938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/5d10b4f5885fb6783c1b16e8dc5fee2a.mp4?t=1788947938\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land on ancient planetoids, make your way to rich deposits, and collect rare resources. Each expedition brings you closer to new discoveries but requires increasingly more caution.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/a6c40f4eab3e0370f7481380b614da29.poster.avif?t=1788947938\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/a6c40f4eab3e0370f7481380b614da29.webm?t=1788947938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/a6c40f4eab3e0370f7481380b614da29.mp4?t=1788947938\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space has no room for mistakes. Fight off hordes of space bandits, monitor your ship\u2019s condition, keep its key systems running, and bring your loot back to base against all odds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/500865985b3c3cece4314cefa57debe8.poster.avif?t=1788947938\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/500865985b3c3cece4314cefa57debe8.webm?t=1788947938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/500865985b3c3cece4314cefa57debe8.mp4?t=1788947938\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your drilling rig and unlock new opportunities for resource extraction and processing. Improve your mining and combat ships to prepare for more challenging missions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"560\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/d77a6b1394d6f00eb9ad2df47e363ead.poster.avif?t=1788947938\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/d77a6b1394d6f00eb9ad2df47e363ead.webm?t=1788947938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/extras/d77a6b1394d6f00eb9ad2df47e363ead.mp4?t=1788947938\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell the materials you\u2019ve gathered, set out in search of new treasures, and gradually uncover the secrets of unexplored worlds. And remember that every expedition makes you stronger and allows you to venture where no burrownaut has ever gone before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Addictive action roguelite about a space miner with nail-biting bullet-heaven battles. Burrow into ancient planetoids, collect resources, upgrade your ship, and defend your base in the middle of a hostile galaxy.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928770/28a80cbbfbd301da49b84bafc7001334ebd0b850/header.jpg?t=1788947938", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Space", "Action", "Resource Management", "PvE", "Procedural Generation"], "developers": "Targem Games", "publishers": "Targem Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4928770", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 September 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/FObdDRi1NEM", "first_seen": 1788904800.0, "review_rank": 22}